<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_III__cl_31> <https://schema.org/name> "The Authority may, with the approval of the"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_III__cl_31> <https://schema.org/text> "Minister, prescribe such by-laws as may be expedient or necessary for the purpose of carrying out the provisions and matters connected with the Exchange."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
