<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_III__cl_33__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "1" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_III__cl_33__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_III__cl_33__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The affairs of the Exchange shall be managed by a committee consisting of not less than five persons who possess relevant experience in financial, commercial or legal matters of whom the chairman and one other person shall be appointed by the Minister and the rest appointed by the Authority."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_III__cl_33__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_III__cl_33> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_III__cl_33__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_III__cl_33__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_III__cl_33__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to Part III, the committee shall have full power in all things to administer the affairs of the Exchange."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_III__cl_33__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_III__cl_33> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_III__cl_33__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_III__cl_33__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_III__cl_33__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to section 53, the provisions of the Offshore Companies Act 1990 shall, unless the context otherwise requires, apply in all respects to the persons who make up the committee as if such persons were directors for the purposes of that Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
