<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_III__cl_34> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "34" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
