<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_III__cl_36> <https://schema.org/name> "Within six months of the end of each financial year"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_III__cl_36> <https://schema.org/text> "the Exchange shall file with the Authority a copy, certified by the secretary as a true copy, of the financial statements of the Exchange for that year prepared and audited in accordance with the provisions of Part VI of the Offshore Companies Act 1990."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
