<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_III__cl_37> <https://schema.org/text> "carrying on a trade or business in Malaysia or with residents of Malaysia for the purpose of any written law by reason only of the fact that —"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
