<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_III__cl_37__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "such person is a trading member and that transactions are effected by it or on its behalf through the facilities of the Exchange; or"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
