<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_25__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Except as provided under subsection 25(2), where the Authority makes a decision on any application made under this Act, it shall not be bound to assign any reasons for such decision."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
