<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_25__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the Authority decides to revoke any consent, licence or registration under paragraph 23(b), the holder of such consent, licence or registration who is aggrieved by the decision may appeal against such decision under section 26."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_25__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_25> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
