<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_25__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The bringing of an appeal under this section suspends the decision appealed against, pending the determination or abandonment of the appeal."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_25__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_25> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
