<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The redemption or purchase of its own shares by a mutual fund which is a company shall not be taken as reducing its authorised share capital and a mutual fund which is a company shall have power to issue shares equal in aggregate par value to the aggregate par value of the shares so redeemed or purchased as if those shares had never been issued and the issuance of such shares under the power herein contained shall not be taken as increasing the amount of its issued share capital."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Sections 66 to 74 inclusive and subsection 147(2) of the Offshore Companies Act 1990 shall not apply to a mutual fund which is established under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection 147(1) of the Offshore Companies Act 1990 shall apply to a mutual fund which is a partnership or a unit trust and such mutual fund shall comply with such other limitations and conditions as may be prescribed."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "5" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "The provisions of the Trustee Act 1949 shall not apply to a trustee of a mutual fund established or registered under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "6" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29__subsec_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 32 of the Securities Commission Act 1993 shall apply except where an offer for subscription or purchase of shares in a mutual fund established under this Act is made to an exempt purchaser or a non-resident."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
