<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_II__cl_29__subsec_7> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding section 3 of the Labuan Offshore Limited Partnerships Act 1997, a partnership established solely for the purpose of establishing a mutual fund under this Act may have more than twenty partners."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
