<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_IV__cl_52__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to subsection 52(2), the Minister may, whenever it appears to him necessary or expedient so to do whether for the purpose of removing difficulties or in consequence of the passing of this Act, by order make such modifications to any provision in any law relating to offshore securities as he may think fit."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
