<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_IV__cl_52__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister shall not exercise the power conferred under subsection 52(1) after the expiration of two years from the commencement of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_IV__cl_53> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_IV> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
