<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_IV__cl_54__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection 7(3), subsection 21(2), section 24, section 85, subsections 87(2), (4), (5) and (10) and subsections 93(2), (6) and (7) of the Offshore Companies Act 1990 shall not be applicable to the Exchange."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_IV__cl_54__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_IV__cl_54> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
