<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_IV__cl_55> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who, on the date of the coming into force of this Act, is carrying on any business or engaged in any activity relating to mutual funds in or from within Labuan shall within six months, or such longer period as the Authority may prescribe in writing, from such date comply with this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_IV__cl_56> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_IV> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
