<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_IV__cl_56> <https://schema.org/name> "The rules of equity and of common law applicable"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@> .
